<Project>
  <!-- The weights this package packs: name, size, sha256 and where each came from. A pack fails when a file is missing or differs.
       To use retrained weights, replace the row (and PROVENANCE.md); no code changes. Weights are never committed.
       Weights are fetched or rebuilt with recipes/models; their sha256 is the one below. -->
  <ItemGroup>
